--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4ecd1a615a340f4c9104ca01624d106, type: 3}
  m_Name: BlueRedButton
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: blue_red_button
  _verb: 2
  _weight: 2
  _narratorPrompt: A room of the newly dead, and two buttons on the wall. Here is
    the rule, and it is the whole game. Press blue and you live. Press red and you
    live only if more than half the room presses blue. You cannot die again, so you
    press for one soul in your charge, not for yourself. Blue keeps that soul safe
    no matter what the room does. Red bets that soul on the room. Whose hands do
    you trust, yours or theirs? Your call.
  _choices:
  - _id: blue
    _label: blue
    _narratorReact: You pressed blue and kept your soul in your own hands. You would
      not gamble one life on a room of strangers. Look at what they chose, and decide
      whether that was wisdom or only habit.
    _narratorReactStruck: 
    _struckParty: 
    _gambledParty: 
    _route: 
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 3
      _value: -1
  - _id: red
    _label: red
    _narratorReact: You pressed red and put your soul in the room's hands, and the
      room held. More than half of them chose blue for a stranger. You trusted them,
      and this once they earned it.
    _narratorReactStruck: You pressed red and bet your soul on the room. They needed
      more than half in blue, and they came up short. The rest pressed red, exactly
      as you did, and doomed the one soul you were meant to protect.
    _struckParty: 
    _gambledParty: charge
    _route: 
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 3
      _value: 1
    - _axis: 0
      _value: 1
  _statsHeading: how the room voted
  _crowdSafeFraction: 0.43
  _crowdThreshold: 0.5
  _thresholdLabel: half
